Z||000000||Goatman||08-29-2001||08:15 PM||||Have any of you thought of putting a Torinado big block drive line into the Fiero?||||reg||1
Z||000001||hugh||08-29-2001||08:34 PM||||I have one,I'm taking out and replacing with a 3800SC.Not big block,ZZ3 Chevy(345HP). <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/hugh_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
